{"id":23595,"author":"PosteGamer","body":"\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/600eb07c5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/600eb07c5\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eFirst Market Transfer.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eAfter the end of the BoE, some players created new teams and other joined in other teams so i am doing this post:\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cb\u003eApollo\u003c/b\u003e: Xuph (\u003ci\u003eCronus\u003c/i\u003e), HotAndCrunch, imryaan \u0026amp; Jiveh \u003ci\u003e(China Baby Toes\u003c/i\u003e) \u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003ehave joined Apollo\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cb\u003eCacalmarin\u003c/b\u003e: jozzmcozz,\u0026nbsp;FutbolHunter,\u0026nbsp;AsianPear,\u0026nbsp;EdenTheKoala,\u0026nbsp;Steven_,\u0026nbsp;WQMBATJr (\u003ci\u003eCronus\u003c/i\u003e), _TinyBear, RantaGrimgar, SevHoe \u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003ehave joinend Cacalmarin\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cb\u003eCameL\u003c/b\u003e: Days before the end of the BoE 1BJ created this new team; Yoa, Creephunter (\u003ci\u003eChina Baby Toes\u003c/i\u003e), 4lextr, Zegita (\u003ci\u003eChina Baby Toes)\u003c/i\u003e, Steyn2g, Kyoal, Ciaan, LFT (\u003ci\u003eCacalmarin\u003c/i\u003e), KroestV2, AlvaroMorata, Emilizzle, Zew, Maxinoxo (\u003ci\u003eApollo\u003c/i\u003e), Blurrynemo, \u0026nbsp;Rememes (\u003ci\u003eChina Baby Toes\u003c/i\u003e) \u0026amp; Buw\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e have joined CameL\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cb\u003eCronus\u003c/b\u003e: _Stixx,\u0026nbsp;xXBatManXx. Chromaah_,\u0026nbsp;armoredmucky,\u0026nbsp;CraftingTheory\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e have joined Cronus.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eelitist room / PowerPuff Boys:\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;BmB, Midnightstorm,\u0026nbsp;Tazz (\u003ci\u003eChina Baby Toes\u003c/i\u003e),\u0026nbsp;FrostedCupcakez,\u0026nbsp;Crazy_Crafter666,\u0026nbsp;InLoc \u0026amp;\u0026nbsp;Tyguy95 \u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003ehave joined elitist room / PowerPuff Boys\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eMars\u003c/b\u003e:\u0026nbsp;avatar_gamed has created a new team called Mars; ssaaaaam,\u0026nbsp;R3DSS\u0026nbsp;armoredkoja armoredelemental,\u0026nbsp;TheCrazySof\u0026nbsp;armoredmath,\u0026nbsp;\u003cfont color=\"#444444\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eSia_Furler,\u0026nbsp;Sowwy,\u0026nbsp;xSped,\u0026nbsp;TheShadowRiegns,\u0026nbsp;Wahiz,\u0026nbsp;P0kemonG0,\u0026nbsp;Taboos,\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;DaddyNatsumii,\u0026nbsp;Kurtiq,\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;Frankieeeee,\u0026nbsp;MackenzieCurry,\u0026nbsp;TheMLGPolarBear,\u0026nbsp;Magikarp, Siht,\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;IPiedKai,\u0026nbsp;Pyraliss \u0026amp; \u0026nbsp;_ImDark \u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003ehave joined Mars\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eNocturne\u003c/b\u003e; Hete / Nerdygirl29 has created a new team called Nocturene; Likoluc,\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;SuperGiraffe66 (PowerPuff Boys),\u0026nbsp;lolfalz,\u0026nbsp;Juanno, Verlion,\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#444444\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eSubtile, iRodRodRod, Wine,\u0026nbsp;Actual_Loser,\u0026nbsp;Zicuri,\u0026nbsp;Vyzu,\u0026nbsp;Fauin,\u0026nbsp;Aurys,\u0026nbsp;Magnace,\u0026nbsp;Axhal,\u0026nbsp;NoahFrom7_11,\u0026nbsp;Compi,\u0026nbsp;Thepawer,\u0026nbsp;LeHappy_ (Ethernal Cross) Shoudi,\u0026nbsp;JustinGayeber\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e have joined Nocturne\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eTeam Rocket\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e: dev_revs has created a new team called Team rocket; (I am tired, i copied and pasted the name of all the players so...)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;dev_revs\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;AutoTool\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space:pre\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;Leyre\u003cspan class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space:pre\"\u003e\t\u00